@segment  briefing-f25
@title    Focus 25 — The Belief System Territories
@levels   F25
@duration ~50s

say You are now in Focus 25.
pause 4
say Tall structures rise on either side of the path of light you travel. Each one houses a belief system. A religion, a philosophy, a worldview. Built and inhabited by those who hold to it. They stretch high above you, lining the way.
pause 10
say You are not stopping here. You move past them on the path of light. Notice them, but do not enter. Continue forward.
pause 8
